  ],
  "core_obligations": [
    "After Faddeev dilogarithm identities and Abel-Plana are given, the author still constructs a manifold-specific two-variable phase, separates boundary/other saddle regions using explicit sign-controlled complex contour directions, and matches the surviving saddle to the quantum invariant. State-integral untrapping and parity/cone residue decomposition construct the analytic matrix cocycle; these mechanisms are not mere stationary-phase substitution. All supporting lemmas bundled once."
  ],
